OL,3,GNEWSACrowds turn out for Tour of
OL,4,ABritain's fourth stage
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people lined the streets to
OL,7,Fwatch the fourth stage of the men's
OL,8,FTour of Britain set off from Helmsley
OL,9,Fon Saturday morning.
OL,11,FThe North Yorkshire town was decked out
OL,12,Fin red, white and blue as the peloton
OL,13,Fpassed through Market Place at 11:00
OL,14,FBST on their 103 miles (166km) route to
OL,15,FLeyburn.
OL,17,FTackling 8,800ft (2,699m) of elevation,
OL,18,Fthe penultimate stage was expected to
OL,19,Fprovide "one of the toughest and most
OL,20,Fdecisive tests of the race", according
OL,21,Fto British Cycling.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
