OL,3,GNEWSACrowds turn out for Tour of
OL,4,ABritain's fourth stage
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents and visitors to Helmsley
OL,7,Fexpressed their delight at the town
OL,8,Fbeing chosen to host the event, with
OL,9,Flocal business owner Carolyn Frank
OL,10,Fpraising the "brilliant atmosphere".
